{"articleNo":"1303","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1303&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"컨설팅R&D센터 예비컨설턴트 교육과정 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.07.13","hit":"9561","attachments":[{"name":"예비컨설턴트 인력양성과정 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1303&attachNo=69941"},{"name":"컨설팅브로슈어-100709.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1303&attachNo=69942"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"6\" face=\"굴림체\">[예비컨설턴트 인력양성 교육과정]</font></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font size=\"5\" face=\"굴림체\">-교육생 선발 및 교육 실시 안내-</font></span><br></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;\n</font></font></p><p></p><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"굴림\">\n</font></font><p></p>\n<br>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"굴림\">예비컨설턴트 교육과정 실시와 관련하여 아래와 같이 안내드리오니 선발된 교육생은 아래의 내용을 숙지하시고 교육에 성실하게 임해주시기 바라며, 또한 컨설팅에 관심 있는 잠재적 컨설턴트의 역량강화에 도움이 되는 보람된 시간이 되시길 바랍니다!</font></span><br></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;\n</font></font></p><p></p><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"굴림\">\n</font></font><p></p>\n<br>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"(견고딕14)\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"굴림\">1. 교육 과정명 : “예비컨설턴트 인력양성 과정”</font></span> </p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"(견고딕14)\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"굴림\">2. 교육 개요 : 글로벌 지식서비스 시대 컨설팅 전문가 역량을 사전에 배양하여 사회 각 분야의 전문가로서 산업전반에 방향을 제시하는 기회를 제공합니다.</font></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"(견고딕14)\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"굴림\">3. 교육 대상 : 컨설팅에 관심있는 기업인, 직장인, 대학생</font></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"(견고딕14)\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"굴림\">☞ 30명(선착순 모집)</font></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"(견고딕14)\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"굴림\">☞&nbsp;수강료 무료</font></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"(견고딕14)\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"굴림\">4. 교육 기간 및 장소 : 2010년 7월 19일(월)~ 23일(금), 26일(월)~30일(금) : 10일간</font></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"(견고딕14)\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"굴림\">☞ PM: 18:00 ~ 21:00 Hr/일(총 30Hr), 금오공과대학교 글로벌관 427호</font></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"(견고딕14)\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"굴림\">5. 운영 방법 : 강의 및 토론</font></span><br></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"굴림\">6. 신청 방법: 첨부파일에 있는 \"예비컨설턴트 인력양성 과정 신청서\"를 작성하여&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;</font></span><a hidefocus=\"hidefocus\" style=\"selector-dummy: true\" href=\"mailto:inew@hanmail.net\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"굴림\">inew@hanmail.net</font></span></u></a><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\"><font face=\"굴림\">으로 발송(선착순 접수).</font></span><br><br></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;\n</font></font></p><p></p><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"굴림\">\n</font></font><p></p>\n<br>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"굴림\">7. 문의 및 상담 : 담당자: 금오공과대학교 컨설팅 R&amp;D센터 연구원 김두열</font></span><br></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Tel. 054)478-7017, Fax. 054)478-7020,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; E-mail: </font></span><a hidefocus=\"hidefocus\" style=\"selector-dummy: true\" href=\"mailto:inew@hanmail.net\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"굴림\">inew@hanmail.net</font></span></u></a><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"굴림\"> </font></span><br></p>\n<p class=\"바탕글\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp; </font></font><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
